---Vulnerability Scan
nmap --script=vuln scanme.nmap.org
# Checks for known CVEs and weaknesses



---Network Discovery
nmap -sn 192.168.1.0/24  (/24 means that first 24 bits are accurate that specifies a certain network)
# Shows all live devices on your network




---Save Results
nmap -A -T4 scanme.nmap.org -oN my_scan.txt


---To view results in file:
cat my_scan.txt


